; A block whose one fix names its own coordinate system, so it solves with
; no system chosen for the attachment. The file names its own *cs out so it
; also solves on its own, as the station harvest runs it; under a driver that
; already set one, cavern ignores this one.
*cs out UTM48N
*begin scoped
*cs UTM48N
*fix S1 500200 3000000 100
*data normal from to tape compass clino
S1 S2 10 0 0
*end scoped
